          "type": "body",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_size": "body-medium",
            "text": "<p>Quality. Durability. Reliability.</p><p>That’s what JanSport stands for. So if your pack ever breaks down, simply return it to our warranty center. We’ll fix it and if we can’t we’ll replace it. We stand by our packs for a lifetime and since we’ve been making packs since 1967, that’s a guarantee you can stand by.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/warranty\" title=\"Warranty\">Learn more about our lifetime warranty and get the address of our warranty center here.</a></p>"
          }
        }
